  {
    "name": "canvas",
    "description": "Draft writing as a doc (Markdown), presentations as a deck. Space files: docs/*.doc.json or decks/*.deck.json; kind from path or create.kind (default deck). Decks: choose the look first (design op=list, create.design); build slides with add_slide{layout,slots,after?}; use color roles and named styles; fix taste: and design: lines. Edit directly when asked, comment when reviewing or unsure. One file per request: edit it, no variants or probes. Never invent data, sources or images (src: https or space file). Decks: /studio, 1920x1080 px, auto-layout; view after layout changes. Docs: read outline or blocks; view pages; export docx/pdf/md/html. Atomic ops; ids/hashes automatic. Field references arrive with results. Comments: anchor to a block; one issue, two sentences with why; attach ops for fixes; at most 8, worst first; respect intent and facts; answer the thread.\n- action=create\n- action=read (needs path)\n- action=view (needs path)\n- action=fonts (needs path)\n- action=edit (needs path, ops)\n- action=comment (needs path, text)\n- action=resolve (needs path, thread)\n- action=history (needs path)\n- action=export (needs path)\n- action=design (needs op)",
    "parameters": {
      "properties": {
        "action": {
          "enum": [
            "create",
            "read",
            "view",
            "fonts",
            "edit",
            "comment",
